            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "When the document is converted to HTML 5 (using the built-in "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "html5"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " backend), each section title becomes a heading element where the heading level matches the number of equal signs. For example, a level 1 section ("
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "=="
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ") maps to an "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
